# A MIDI clock coming in: Start plays the song on screen from its start, Stop pauses, Continue goes
# on. With SID+CLK and a beat found, the tune follows the clock: Commando (125 BPM) at 120 and then
# 140, its beats within a millisecond of the clock's; SiDJ sends no clock of its own meanwhile.
# Without SID+CLK, Start and Stop only, at the tune's own tempo.
sid @SID1@
midi fa 0 0
wait 500
expect mode 1
expect playing 1
expect follow 0
midi fc 0 0
wait 500
expect playing 0
tap SEQ
expect mode 0
turn K2 3
expect output 3
clockin 120
wait 300
midi fa 0 0
wait 4500
expect playing 1
expect clk_on 1
expect follow 1
expect follow_bpm >1198
expect follow_bpm <1202
wait 2000
expect follow_err <20
midi fc 0 0
wait 500
expect playing 0
midi fb 0 0
wait 3000
expect playing 1
expect follow_err <20
clockin 140
wait 3000
expect follow_bpm >1398
expect follow_bpm <1402
expect follow_err <20
expect clk_starts 0
expect clk_pulses 0
clockin 0
wait 1000
expect follow 0
